{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"ambiguous","details":{"next":"ployz link --project PROJECT","projects":["blog","shop"]},"message":"Name a Project: this Organization has more than one"}}

=== service ls: unknown --project :: $ ployz service ls --project nope
error: No Project named nope

=== service ls --json: unknown --project :: $ ployz --json service ls --project nope
{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"not_found","details":{},"message":"No Project named nope"}}

=== get: unknown --env :: $ ployz get --project shop --env nope
error: No Environment named nope in Project shop
next: ployz env new nope --project shop

