{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"unavailable","details":null,"message":"The Config Store's key file can't be read or created"}}

=== bad PLOYZ_STORE scheme :: $ env PLOYZ_STORE=postgres://x ployz project ls
error: The Config Store is unavailable; retry the command

=== no Store, no sign-in (no PLOYZ_STORE) :: $ env -u PLOYZ_STORE ployz project ls
error: Not signed in to Cloud.
next: ployz login

=== no Store, no sign-in --json :: $ env -u PLOYZ_STORE ployz --json project ls
{"error":{"cause":[],"code":"unauthenticated","details":{"next":"ployz login"},"message":"Not signed in to Cloud."}}

